  shortDescription: Reduce incoming damage by flat 10%. Diminishing Returns apply.
  longDescription: Reducing incoming damage by flat 10%. Each application only compounds
    damage reduction on the remaining damage of each incoming hit.
  notes: The flat % should be calculated out of the damage remainder. If it was 2%,
    the first stack would leave 98% damage taken and the second stack would reduce
    by 2% of 98%.
